{"ID":"20231122152455-66r5u2z","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20231122152455-66r5u2z","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122152455-66r5u2z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160031-bj3tgvv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160031-8fyx52v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:215,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122160031-8fyx52v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:125,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:125\u0026#125;","title":"第三十篇 阳明脉解","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231122160031-bj3tgvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-bj3tgvv","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本篇要点："}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-jpp82k4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-jpp82k4","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本篇是解释阳明经脉的实热症状和病理变化，可与《灵枢.经脉篇》参看。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-11pmm2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-11pmm2q","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文与译文:"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-xwgw1i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-xwgw1i7","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问曰：足阳明之脉病，恶人与火，闻木音则惕然而惊，钟鼓不为动，闻木音而惊何也？愿闻其故。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-zkevp1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-zkevp1e","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝问道：足阳明的经脉发生病变，恶见人与火，听到木器响动的声音就受惊，但听到敲打钟鼓的声音却不为惊动。为什麽听到木音就惊惕？我希望听听其中道理。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-vphja59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-vphja59","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对曰：阳明者，胃脉也，胃者土也，故闻木音而惊者，土恶木也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-0tefoem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-0tefoem","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：足阳明是胃的经脉，属土。所以听到木音而惊惕，是因为土恶木克的缘故。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-65srgqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-65srgqt","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：善。其恶火何也？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-i97eh33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-i97eh33","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：好！那麽恶火是为什麽呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-u8eu2mf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-u8eu2mf","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：阳明主肉，其脉血气盛，邪客之则热，热甚则恶火。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-m7w6zqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-m7w6zqi","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：足阳明经主肌肉，其经脉多血多气，外邪侵袭则发热，热甚则所以恶火。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-7bcb0k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-7bcb0k1","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：其恶人何也？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-8i2zz3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-8i2zz3i","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：其恶人是何道理？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-9xscssx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-9xscssx","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：阳明厥则喘而惋，惋则恶人。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-8cp2zy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-8cp2zy3","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：足阳明经气上逆，则呼吸喘促，心中郁闷，所以不喜欢见人。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-1hdbqiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-1hdbqiz","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：或喘而死者，或喘而生者，何也？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-s4btp2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-s4btp2a","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：有的阳明厥逆喘促而死，有的虽喘促而不死，这是为什麽呢？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-u746a6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-u746a6l","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：厥逆连脏则死，连经则生。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-rnkaq36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-rnkaq36","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：经气厥逆若累及于内脏，则病深重而死；若仅连及外在的经脉，则病轻浅可生。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-0jrrr9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-0jrrr9j","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝曰：善。病甚则弃衣而走，登高而歌，或至不食数日，逾垣上屋，所上之处，皆非其素所能也，病反能者何也？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-z92f1x4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-z92f1x4","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄帝道：好！有的阳明病重之时，病人把衣服脱掉乱跑乱跳，登上高处狂叫唱歌，或者数日不进饮食，并能够越墙上屋，而所登上之处，都是其平素所不能的，有了病反能够上去，这是什麽原因？"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-jtrxmzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-jtrxmzj","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯曰：四肢者诸阳之本也。阳盛则四肢实，实则能登高也。帝曰：其弃衣而走者何也？岐伯曰：热盛于身，故弃衣欲走也。帝曰：其妄言骂詈，不避亲疏而歌者何也？岐伯曰：阳盛则使人妄言骂詈，不避亲疏而欲食，不欲食故妄走也。"}]},{"ID":"20231122160031-8fyx52v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122160031-8fyx52v","updated":"20231122160031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岐伯说：四肢是阳气的根本。阳气盛则四肢充实，所以能够登高。黄帝道：其不穿衣服而到处乱跑。黄帝道：其胡言乱语骂人，不避亲疏而随便唱歌，是什麽道理？岐伯说：阳热亢盛而扰动心神，故使其神志失常，胡言乱语，斥骂别人，不避亲疏，并且不知道吃饭，所以便到处乱跑。"}]}]}